career:VocationConfirmationStage a ar:DecisionStage ; ar:sequence 2 ; skos:prefLabel "Amatyakaraka and Karakamsha confirmation"@en ; ar:stageRequiresFactor career:Amatyakaraka, career:Karakamsha .
career:DeliveryTimingStage a ar:DecisionStage ; ar:sequence 9 ; skos:prefLabel "Dasha delivery with transit confirmation"@en ; ar:stageRequiresFactor career:DashaActivation, career:TransitActivation .

